Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.97,0:00:14.01,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she died...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:28.36,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,N-No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:30.26,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:32.49,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.49,0:00:34.13,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:35.90,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Elma?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:36.63,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Elma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:39.84,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Elma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.84,0:00:42.20,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Stay with me, Elma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.84,0:00:46.11,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Elma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:50.85,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Arlen...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.85,0:00:52.35,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Elma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.35,0:00:56.12,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,To think that monster was you. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.12,0:00:59.35,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Arlen... please...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.35,0:01:02.19,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,The stone… Destroy the stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.19,0:01:07.73,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,{\fs29.5}The stone? What stone? What do you mean by stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:11.90,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,A big, big red stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:15.27,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,If you destroy it, he will...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.27,0:01:22.01,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,A red stone? Understood. I will. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.75,0:01:29.38,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:37.53,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Please, this time... that man must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.53,0:01:43.53,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.27,0:01:48.94,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Elma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.94,0:01:52.64,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Arlen… goodbye...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:55.78,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.41,0:02:00.52,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Elma...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:01.62,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Elma...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:03.15,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Elma...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:04.52,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Elma!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.89,0:02:14.03,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Elma...
